SUMMARY:The Political Party with Matt Forde: Guest Douglas Alexander
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Matt Forde will be talking to Douglas Alexander\, Secretary of 
 State for Scotland. Alexander has held the position since 2025\, having pre
 viously held the position from 2006 to 2007. A member of the Labour Party\,
  he has been MP for Lothian East since 2024\, and was previously MP for Pai
 sley and Renfrewshire South from 1997 to 2015. He's served in the cabinets 
 of Tony Blair and Gordon Brown\, and held the position of International Dev
 elopment Secretary from 2007 to 2010.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/c
 omedy-atlas/event/the-political-party-with-matt-forde-guest-douglas-alexand
 er/
